                                "sense_id": "10da8dde-796b-316b-928a-7841b5888b45",
                                "text": "The caustic oil of Anacardium is composed of approximately 82% anacardic acid, 13.8% cardol, 2.6% 2-methyl cardol, and 1.6% cardanol (Tyman 1976)"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "05ad6b47-88f6-4345-88d0-f43786711f9d",
                                "sense_id": "10da8dde-796b-316b-928a-7841b5888b45",
                                "text": "This technical oil is dark colored; even after distillation it darkens again, supposedly due to its cardol content."
                            },
