                                "sense_id": "10da8dde-796b-316b-928a-7841b5888b45",
                                "text": "Even though the source of cardanol and cardol used in the study was not CNSL , it is worthwhile to mention that the observations obtained can be applicable to cardanol from CNSL as well."
